   "idx": 3,
   "zh": "很高兴和各位新老朋友相聚在美丽的江南水乡，共同出席2026年世界互联网大会乌镇峰会。首先，我谨代表中国政府，对各位嘉宾的到来表示诚挚欢迎！对大家长期以来给予中国网信事业发展的关心支持表示衷心感谢！",
   "en": "It is a pleasure to gather here with all of you—friends old and new—in this beautiful water town in southern China for the opening of the 2026 World Internet Conference Wuzhen Summit. On behalf of the Chinese government, I wish to extend a warm welcome to all participants and express our heartfelt thanks to all of you who have cared about and supported China’s Internet and information development over the years.",
