  },
  {
   "idx": 4,
   "zh": "世界互联网大会已经连续举办了13年。回想十多年前，4G刚刚铺开，“云”还在等待“风”来，人工智能尚未走出实验室。今天，各种新技术目不暇接，互联网已经发生翻天覆地的变化，万物互联、智能互联走进千家万户、赋能千行百业。但我们更应看到，尽管技术发展日新月异，人们普遍关心的一个重大命题却始终没有变，那就是如何让互联网更好造福人类。",
   "en": "This year marks the 13th edition of the World Internet Conference. More than a decade ago, 4G was just rolled out, cloud computing was waiting for its moment, and AI had yet to leave the laboratory. Today, new technologies are emerging one after another, and the Internet has undergone dramatic changes. The Internet of Things and intelligent connectivity are reaching countless households and empowering all industries. But more importantly, despite rapid technological advances, one major question of common concern remains unchanged: how can the Internet better benefit humanity?",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
