    23
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 5,
   "zh": "习近平主席早在2015年世界互联网大会上就提出构建网络空间命运共同体理念，为解决互联网发展和治理问题提供了中国方案。多年来，中国始终坚持与国际社会密切合作，促进互联网创新发展和有效治理。如今，互联网已经深度融入人们的生产生活，这个曾经的“技术增量”已经变成了“时代常量”。随着技术持续突破、世界日益融合，这个常量又逐渐成为影响人类社会发展的“历史变量”，需要我们以面向未来、更加开阔的视角来认识和把握。借此机会，我想同大家分享三点思考。",
   "en": "At the 2015 World Internet Conference, President Xi Jinping put forward the vision of building a community with a shared future in cyberspace, offering a Chinese approach to Internet development and governance. Over the years, China has worked closely with the international community to promote the innovation-driven development and effective governance of the Internet. Now, the Internet is deeply integrated into people’s daily life and production. What was once a “technological increment” has become a “constant of our times.” As technology continues to make breakthroughs and the world becomes increasingly interconnected, this constant is also becoming a “historical variable” that shapes the development of human society. This requires us to understand and grasp it from a future-oriented and broader perspective. In this connection, I would like to take this opportunity to share three observations with you.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
