    26
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 6,
   "zh": "互联网发展正在经历智能化变革和系统性跃迁",
   "en": "I. Internet development is undergoing an intelligent transformation and a systemic leap.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
