  },
  {
   "idx": 7,
   "zh": "当前，互联网与人工智能、云计算、区块链等技术加速融合，迈向智能互联网，对经济社会发展产生更为广泛而深刻的影响。",
   "en": "We meet at a time when the Internet is converging at an accelerating pace with technologies such as AI, cloud computing and blockchain, and moving toward an intelligent Internet that will have an even broader and more profound impact on economic and social development.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    31,
