   ],
   "ep": [
    32,
    32
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 8,
   "zh": "互联网不仅是一种基础设施，更是全新生活方式。历经多年发展，互联网已经无处不在、无时不有、无所不及，人们日用而不觉。我们此刻所在的千年古镇，互联网元素全方位融入，云端互联、赛博栖居、智慧生活成为日常。智能网联汽车、服务机器人、智能眼镜等越来越多的新终端成为互联网的新触角，正在塑造全新生活方式，创造美好生活无限可能。",
   "en": "First, the Internet is not merely infrastructure; it is shaping an entirely new way of life. After years of development, the Internet is now ubiquitous and ever-present, reaching into every corner of our lives, and being used every day and taken for granted. Here in this thousand-year-old town, Internet elements are integrated in every dimension: cloud connectivity, cyber habitation, and smart living have become commonplace. A growing array of new terminals—intelligent connected vehicles, service robots, smart glasses, and more—are becoming new touchpoints for the Internet and will shape a new way of living and unlock boundless possibilities for a better future.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    34,
    34
   ],
   "ep": [
    35,
    35
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 9,
   "zh": "互联网不仅是一种技术手段，更是产业变革动能。这些年，互联网通过连接线上与线下、生产与消费、城市与乡村，催动各行各业显著提高效率、发生深刻变革。在互联网加持下，技术研发周期大幅缩短，定制化柔性化生产蓬勃兴起，贸易突破时空限制、得到极大拓展。随着互联网与各类新技术融合叠加，算电数网联为一体、相互协同，将促进产业组织形态、生产方式等发生新的跃升，更大释放经济增长潜力。",
   "en": "Second, the Internet is not merely a technological means; it is a driving force for industrial transformation. Over the years, by bridging the online and offline, production and consumption, and urban and rural areas, the Internet has driven remarkable efficiency gains and profound changes across all sectors of the economy. Empowered by the Internet, R&D cycles have been significantly shortened, customized and flexible production is flourishing, and trade has broken free from the constraints of time and space, and has been greatly expanded. As the Internet converges and combines with new technologies, computing, electricity, data, and networks are becoming deeply integrated and mutually reinforcing. This will drive new leaps in industrial organization and production methods, unlocking new potential for economic growth.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    37,
    37
   ],
   "ep": [
    38,
    38
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 10,
   "zh": "互联网不仅是一种信息载体，更是智能生成力量。回首过去，无论从门户网站到搜索引擎，还是从网络社交到移动互联，互联网的角色都是知识与信息的承载者和传播者。随着越来越多大模型、智能体的接入，互联网正在向智能连接、人机协同演变，开始具备自我学习、决策、执行、进化的能力，这将进一步拓展思考边界，加速群体智慧涌现，为人类文明进步提供澎湃动力和强劲活力。",
   "en": "Third, the Internet is not merely an information carrier; it is a force for intelligent generation. Over the years, from web portals to search engines, from online social networking to mobile network, the Internet has always served as a vehicle for carrying and disseminating knowledge and information. With the integration of an increasing number of large models and intelligent agents, the Internet is evolving toward intelligent connectivity and human-machine collaboration, and is beginning to acquire capabilities for self-learning, decision-making, execution and autonomous evolution. This will broaden the horizon of the mind, accelerate the emergence of collective intelligence, and provide powerful energy and momentum for the progress of human civilization.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    40,
