   ],
   "ep": [
    41,
    41
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 11,
   "zh": "当今时代互联网发展需要更加突出以人为本的价值取向",
   "en": "II. In today’s world, Internet development needs to place greater emphasis on a people-centered value orientation.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
