  {
   "idx": 12,
   "zh": "互联网在人工智能等新技术的驱动下，正以超乎想象的速度演进，互联网的发展也站在了到底是技术至上还是以人为本的十字路口。不少人担心，一旦滑入技术万能的陷阱，人文精神被技术逻辑所压倒，创新就会走向失控和迷途，人可能被裹挟，文明可能被裁剪。我们认为，互联网发展的最终目的，必须是促进人的全面发展。我们倡议构建网络空间命运共同体，就是希望互联网相关技术能够增强人的能力、拓展人的选择、彰显人的价值、增进人的福祉，而不能让人成为技术的附庸，更不能让技术加剧人类发展的分化。从这一考量出发，有几个问题尤其值得关注。",
   "en": "Driven by AI and other new technologies, the Internet is evolving at a pace one could never have imagined, and its development now stands at a crossroads: should it go for technological supremacy or take a people-centered approach? Many worry that if we fall into the trap of believing that technology is omnipotent and allow technological logic to overwhelm the humanistic spirit, innovation will spin out of control and lose its way, individuals may be swept along, and civilization may be trimmed to fit. We believe the ultimate purpose of Internet development must be to promote people’s all-round development. Our initiative to build a community with a shared future in cyberspace is intended to ensure that Internet-related technologies enhance people’s capabilities, expand their choices, affirm human worth, and improve their well-being—rather than make people subordinate to technology, still less allow technology to exacerbate divisions in human development. With this in mind, several issues deserve particular attention.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    47,
    47
   ],
   "ep": [
    48,
    48
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 13,
   "zh": "一是“人与机器”的关系之辨。万物智联的条件下，互联网将人与机器深度相联，传统的人与机器之间“使用与被使用”的关系越发模糊，很多过去只有人类才能完成的活动逐渐被机器所替代。现在有不少人说，“机器越来越像人，而人却越来越像机器”。这引发了人被机器所操控的担忧，带来了人类何去何从的危机感。技术大爆发的时代，人与机器如何相处，如何确保技术始终处于人类控制之下，如何保持“人之为人”的精神和特质，成为亟待应对的新挑战。互联网和人工智能应该是人的能力延伸，是解放人的手段，而不应成为对人的全面取代。无论互联网多么强大、人工智能多么“类人”，都必须坚持人的主导性，让机器始终成为人类的可信工具，帮助人类实现更高质量的就业和自身发展。",
   "en": "First, the entangled relationship between humans and machines. In an era of intelligent connectivity, the Internet is connecting people and machines ever more deeply, and the traditional relationship of “using and being used” between them is becoming increasingly blurred. Activities that once only humans could perform are gradually being taken over by machines. Many now say, “Machines are becoming more and more like humans, while humans are becoming more and more like machines.” This has fueled fears that humans will be controlled by machines and created a sense of crisis about where humanity is headed. In this age of technological explosion, how do humans coexist with machines, how to ensure that technology remains under human control, and how to preserve the spirit and qualities that make us human? These have become urgent new challenges. The Internet and AI should extend human capabilities and serve as means of liberation, not as wholesale replacements for people. However powerful the Internet becomes, and however “human-like” AI may be, human agency must remain paramount. Machines must remain trustworthy tools that help people achieve higher-quality employment and develop themselves more fully.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    50,
    50
   ],
   "ep": [
    51,
    51
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 14,
   "zh": "二是“算法模型”的伦理之思。算法模型虽是人工智能的重要标识，但也已渗透到了互联网的方方面面。互联网运用算法模型来服务人，也潜移默化地影响人，在带来高效率的同时，也对传统的人文精神和人类伦理形成冲击。人们时常感叹，“算法比你自己更了解你”。当算法只认效率优先，普通劳动者就可能被困在系统之中。当大数据杀熟侵害权益，公平诚信的价值原则就可能遭受破坏。当算法偏见放大分歧，社会对立就可能加剧。当信息茧房固化认知，多样知识和文化交流就可能受到阻碍。人类发展实践表明，工具理性和价值理性不可偏废，技术不应只追求效率至上，更应承载人文精神、坚持向上向善。要用全人类共同价值筑牢新技术发展底座，使新技术更好服务人的意志、满足人的需求、遵循人类社会的道德准则。",
   "en": "Second, the ethical implications of algorithms and models. Algorithms and models are the signature of AI, yet they have seeped into every corner of the Internet. The Internet employs them to serve us and also to quietly shape us. They bring efficiency, but also unsettle traditional humanistic spirit and human ethics. People often lament, “The algorithm knows you better than you know yourself.” When algorithms put efficiency above all else, ordinary workers may get trapped in the system. When big-data price discrimination tramples on rights and interests, the principles of fairness and honesty may be undermined. When algorithmic bias widens differences, social division may intensify. When information cocoons harden our views, knowledge diversity and cultural exchange may get impeded. As human development has shown, instrumental rationality and value rationality must go hand in hand; technology should not chase efficiency alone; more importantly, it must carry a humanistic core and stay positive. We must underpin new technologies with the common values of humanity so that they can better serve human will, meet human needs, and observe the moral code of human society.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    53,
    53
   ],
   "ep": [
    54,
    54
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 15,
   "zh": "三是“数实融合”的安全之虞。互联网连接万事万物、联通现实与虚拟，为人类社会提供了前所未有的便利和机遇，同时也带来前所未有的安全风险。新的安全风险一旦爆发，其范围更广、方式更加隐蔽，现实冲击也愈加难以预测。网络攻击、数据窃取影响社会稳定运行，模型“幻觉”、数据“投毒”干扰社会客观认知，深度伪造、虚假信息冲击社会信任。在数实融合不断加速的今天，智能电网、智能家居、智能工厂等遍布生产生活各类场景，迫切需要更加可控的技术创新、更加严密的安全防范、更加充分的协同合作，更好统筹发展和安全，共同维护人类社会的和平安宁。",
   "en": "Third, the security risks of digital-physical integration. The Internet links everything and connects the real and virtual worlds. While bringing unprecedented convenience and opportunities to the human society, it also causes unprecedented security risks. New security risks, once materialized, would have wider impacts in more covert ways, with real-world consequences ever harder to predict. Cyberattacks and data theft undermine social stability; model hallucinations and data poisoning distort public perception of reality; deepfakes and disinformation corrode public trust. As digital-physical integration speeds up, smart grids, smart homes, and smart factories have become part of our daily work and life. It is therefore imperative for us to have more controllable technology innovation, more robust security safeguards, and more comprehensive cooperation, so as to better balance development with security and jointly maintain peace and security of the human society.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    56,
    56
   ],
   "ep": [
    57,
    57
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 16,
   "zh": "四是“数智鸿沟”的公平之治。技术进步带来新的发展红利，但也可能形成新的不平等和发展鸿沟，缺乏网络覆盖的地区可能成为“数字孤岛”，数字素养不足的人群可能陷入“数字困境”。尤其是人工智能等新技术的发展能级更高、迭代速度更快，马太效应也更明显。现在，全球还有20多亿人没有接入互联网。各国在人工智能大模型、高质量数据集、高性能算力、高速率通信网络等方面差距很大，如果不采取有效措施，南北发展失衡、社会贫富分化可能进一步加剧，最终可能演变成为时代裂痕。如何让技术进步的成果真正为全社会成员共享，确保新技术成为造福世界的公共产品，是关系全人类共同福祉的时代课题。",
   "en": "Fourth, the quest for fairness in addressing the digital and AI divide. The advance of technology brings new development dividends, but it can also breed new inequalities and development gaps. Areas without Internet access may turn into isolated “digital islands”; people short on digital literacy may fall into “digital predicaments.” Most notably, with higher capability and faster iteration, the development of AI and other new technologies would magnify the Matthew Effect. Today, more than two billion people worldwide are still offline. In large AI models, high-quality datasets, high-performance computing power, and high-speed communication networks, a huge gap exists between countries. Without effective measures, the North-South development imbalance and the wealth divide could grow wider and ultimately evolve into a rift of our times. How can we ensure that the fruits of technological progress reach everyone in society and that new technologies become public goods benefiting the whole world? That is the defining question of our times, one that bears on the well-being of all humanity.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    59,
    59
   ],
   "ep": [
    60,
    60
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 17,
   "zh": "携手构建网络空间命运共同体",
   "en": "III. We need to jointly build a community with a shared future in cyberspace.",
   "kind": "para",
