  {
   "idx": 18,
   "zh": "当世界连成一体，当机器开始思考，人类的前途命运从未如此紧密地联系在一起。面对新与旧转换、危与机并存、变与不变同在的时代大势，没有任何国家能够独善其身。国际社会需要凝聚共识、相向而行，携手构建内涵更加丰富的网络空间命运共同体。",
   "en": "When our world becomes an interconnected whole and the machine begins to have a mind of its own, humanity’s future is more closely intertwined than ever before. Living in an era where the old gives way to the new, risks coexist with opportunities, and changes unfold alongside constancy, no country can prosper on its own. Members of the international community must forge stronger consensus and move in the same direction to jointly build a community with a shared future in cyberspace that is more substantive in content.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    65,
    65
   ],
   "ep": [
    66,
    66
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 19,
   "zh": "坚持科技赋能，开拓新的发展空间。互联网和人工智能快速发展带来重大机遇，我们应当加大科技创新力度，鼓励开源开放，加强联合攻关，支持新技术新产品规模化应用。中国将继续坚持开门搞创新，促进技术转移和知识分享，与各国一道打造开放包容、充满活力的全球数字创新生态，共同推动互联网创新发展，为全球经济增长注入新动能。",
   "en": "First, we should harness the power of technology to open new grounds for development. The rapid advance of the Internet and AI brings significant opportunities. We should bolster scientific and technological innovation, encourage open source and openness, strengthen collaborative research and support large-scale application of new technologies and products. China will continue to pursue open innovation, promote technology transfer and knowledge sharing, and work with all to build an open, inclusive and dynamic global ecosystem for digital innovation, push for innovative development of the Internet and cultivate new drivers for global growth.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    68,
    68
   ],
   "ep": [
    69,
    69
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 20,
   "zh": "坚持可信可控，筑牢数字安全屏障。技术创新越是加速，安全缰绳越要握紧。我们应当坚持共同、综合、合作、可持续的安全观，全面加强数字领域安全务实合作，防止技术失控滥用。同时，要反对泛化国家安全概念，反对构筑“数字铁幕”。中国将始终尊重各国网络安全合理关切，与各国同舟共济应对安全挑战，共同筑牢数字安全屏障。",
   "en": "Second, we should ensure credibility and controllability to strengthen the shields of digital security. The faster technology innovates, the more we need to keep a tight rein on security. We should stay committed to promoting common, comprehensive, cooperative and sustainable security, and step up practical cooperation to ensure security across the digital domain and prevent the loss of control and abuse of technology. Meanwhile, we need to oppose overstretching the concept of national security and erecting digital iron curtains. China will respect the legitimate cybersecurity concerns of all countries and work with all in the world to confront security challenges and strengthen the safeguards for digital security.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    71,
    71
   ],
   "ep": [
    72,
    72
   ]
  },
  {
